1
00:00:05,718 --> 00:00:07,388
(knocking on door)
Hi.

2
00:00:07,386 --> 00:00:08,316
(Leonard:)Hey.

3
00:00:08,321 --> 00:00:09,621
(Bernadette:)We brought snacks
for movie night.

4
00:00:09,622 --> 00:00:10,992
(Penny:)Oh, great.

5
00:00:10,990 --> 00:00:12,960
(Penny:)I don't suppose you also brought
napkins, clean bowls,

6
00:00:12,959 --> 00:00:14,759
(Penny:)utensils and a roll
of toilet paper.

7
00:00:14,760 --> 00:00:15,760
(Bernadette:)Right here.

8
00:00:15,761 --> 00:00:17,791
Ah!

9
00:00:17,797 --> 00:00:19,167
(Penny:)You guys are the best.

10
00:00:19,165 --> 00:00:20,235
(Amy:)What's with the clothes?

11
00:00:20,233 --> 00:00:22,163
(Penny:)Well, with all the new stuff
I bought for work,

12
00:00:22,168 --> 00:00:23,938
(Penny:)I needed to make room
in my closet.

13
00:00:23,936 --> 00:00:25,436
(Amy:)I meant why are they folded?

14
00:00:25,438 --> 00:00:27,738
(Amy:)But whatever.

15
00:00:27,740 --> 00:00:30,240
(Amy:)Ooh, what's this?

16
00:00:30,243 --> 00:00:33,273
(Penny:)That, believe it or not,
is my prom dress.

17
00:00:33,279 --> 00:00:35,449
(Bernadette:)Wow, you still have it?

18
00:00:35,448 --> 00:00:37,078
(Bernadette:)I just assumed
it was balled up

19
00:00:37,083 --> 00:00:40,383
(Bernadette:)in the corner
of a barn somewhere.

20
00:00:42,955 --> 00:00:45,355
(Penny:)What kind of teenager
did you think I was?

21
00:00:45,358 --> 00:00:47,228
(Bernadette:)Slutty.
Easy.

22
00:00:48,761 --> 00:00:51,231
The word is "popular."

23
00:00:52,431 --> 00:00:54,501
(Bernadette:)How was your prom?
Did you go?

24
00:00:54,500 --> 00:00:56,000
(Amy:)No, but I was
on clean-up crew.

25
00:00:56,002 --> 00:00:57,632
(Penny:)Aw, that's sad.

26
00:00:57,637 --> 00:00:59,307
(Amy:)No, it was okay.

27
00:00:59,305 --> 00:01:01,875
(Amy:)The DJ let me dance
one slow song with my mop

